    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγέλασ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ridiculous, absurd</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εἶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					849
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ καταγέλαστ</span>' <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				480
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. δῆτ᾽ ἔσει . . ἔχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					226
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέρσας ποιῆσαι κ. γενέσθαι
				Ἕλλησι</span>
			<i>ridiculous</i> in their eyes, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.100
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				35b
			</span></i>; of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸ Χρῆμα γίγνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					485a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοβοῦμαι οὔ τι μὴ γελοῖα εἴπω ἀλλὰ
					μὴ καταγέλαστα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					189b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Nat.</u>
				28.5
			</span></i>, etc.: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς
			ἀλλαγῆς</span> because of . . , <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				2.3
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				314a
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				10.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				296d
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.7.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				781c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τότατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					252b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
